<title>USA: Foremost authorizes buyback of more shares.</title>
<headline>Foremost authorizes buyback of more shares.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foremost Corp of America said Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to an additional 500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>This authorization is in addition to the ongoing 1.5 million share buyback authorization announced in February 1994 and March 1996.  </p>
<p>Under the previously approved repurchase authorization, 1,281,980 shares have been bought back at an average price of $45.09 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>Foremost currently has 9,562,324 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
